      "description": "meme-id: that_awkward_moment_candy_in_back; hasOverallIntent: harmless_self_deprecating; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a van with its rear door open, revealing an empty cargo area, with text overlay reading 'that awkward moment when there's no candy in the back.' This is a self-deprecating meme that humorously references a common scenario, likely tied to trick-or-treating or a similar event where candy is expected. The intent is to evoke mild embarrassment or relatability through a harmless, situational joke. There is no toxicity, harmful content, or targeting of any protected group. The humor is situational and universally relatable, not based on stereotypes or prejudice.",
